H7700.definition:
from H7736 (שׁוּד);
a doemon (as malignant)
KJV: devil.

H7701.definition:
or שׁוֹד; (Job 5:21), from H7736 (שׁוּד);
violence, ravage
KJV: desolation, destruction, oppression, robbery, spoil(-ed, -er, -ing), wasting.

H7702.definition:
a primitive root;
to abrade, i.e. harrow afield
KJV: break clods, harrow.

H7703.definition:
a primitive root;
properly, to be burly, i.e. (figuratively) powerful (passively, impregnable); by implication, to ravage
KJV: dead, destroy(-er), oppress, robber, spoil(-er), [idiom] utterly, (lay) waste.

H7704.definition:
or שָׂדַי; from an unused root meaning to spread out;
a field (as flat)
KJV: country, field, ground, land, soil, [idiom] wild.

H7705.definition:
from H7703 (שָׁדַד);
a wife (as mistress of the house)
KJV: [idiom] all sorts, musical instrument.

H7706.definition:
from H7703 (שָׁדַד);
the Almighty
KJV: Almighty.

H7707.definition:
from the same as H7704 (שָׂדֶה) and H217 (אוּר); spreader of light;
Shedejur, an Israelite
KJV: Shedeur.

H7708.definition:
plural from the same as H7704 (שָׂדֶה); flats;
Siddim, a valley in Palestine
KJV: Siddim.

H7709.definition:
apparently from H7704 (שָׂדֶה);
a cultivated field
KJV: blasted, field.

H7710.definition:
a primitive root;
to scorch
KJV: blast.

H7711.definition:
or שִׁדָּפוֹן; from H7710 (שָׁדַף);
blight
KJV: blasted(-ing).

H7712.definition:
(Aramaic) a primitive root;
to endeavor
KJV: labour.

H7713.definition:
from an unused root meaning to regulate;
a row, i.e. rank (of soldiers), story (of rooms)
KJV: board, range.

H7714.definition:
probably of foreign origin;
Shadrak, the Babylonian name of one of Daniel's companions
KJV: Shadrach.

H7715.definition:
(Aramaic) the same as H7714 (שַׁדְרַךְ)
{Shadrak, the Babylonian name of one of Daniel's companions}
KJV: Shadrach.

H7716.definition:
or שֵׂי; probably from H7582 (שָׁאָה) through the idea of pushing out to graze;
a member of a flock, i.e. a sheep or goat
KJV: (lesser, small) cattle, ewe, goat, lamb, sheep. Compare H2089 (זֶה).

H7717.definition:
from an unused root meaning to testify;
a witness
KJV: record.

H7718.definition:
from an unused root probably mean to blanch;
a gem, probably the beryl (from its pale green color)
KJV: onyx.

H7719.definition:
the same as H7718 (שֹׁהַם);
Shoham, an Israelite
KJV: Shoham.

H7720.definition:
from the same as H5469 (סַהַר);
a round pendant for the neck
KJV: ornament, round tire like the moon.

H7721.definition:
from an unused root (akin to H5375 (נָשָׂא) and H7722 (שׁוֹא)) meaning to rise;
a rising
KJV: arise.

H7722.definition:
or (feminine) שׁוֹאָה; or שֹׁאָה; from an unused root meaning to rush over;
a tempest; by implication, devastation
KJV: desolate(-ion), destroy, destruction, storm, wasteness.

H7723.definition:
or שַׁו; from the same as H7722 (שׁוֹא) in the sense of desolating;
evil (as destructive), literally (ruin) or morally (especially guile); figuratively idolatry (as false, subjective), uselessness (as deceptive, objective; also adverbially, in vain)
KJV: false(-ly), lie, lying, vain, vanity.

H7724.definition:
from the same as H7723 (שָׁוְא); false;
Sheva, an Israelite
KJV: Sheva.

H7725.definition:
a primitive root;
to turn back (hence, away) transitively or intransitively, literally or figuratively (not necessarily with the idea of return to the starting point); generally to retreat; often adverbial, again
KJV: ((break, build, circumcise, dig, do anything, do evil, feed, lay down, lie down, lodge, make, rejoice, send, take, weep)) [idiom] again, (cause to) answer ([phrase] again), [idiom] in any case (wise), [idiom] at all, averse, bring (again, back, home again), call (to mind), carry again (back), cease, [idiom] certainly, come again (back), [idiom] consider, [phrase] continually, convert, deliver (again), [phrase] deny, draw back, fetch home again, [idiom] fro, get (oneself) (back) again, [idiom] give (again), go again (back, home), (go) out, hinder, let, (see) more, [idiom] needs, be past, [idiom] pay, pervert, pull in again, put (again, up again), recall, recompense, recover, refresh, relieve, render (again), requite, rescue, restore, retrieve, (cause to, make to) return, reverse, reward, [phrase] say nay, send back, set again, slide back, still, [idiom] surely, take back (off), (cause to, make to) turn (again, self again, away, back, back again, backward, from, off), withdraw.

H7726.definition:
from H7725 (שׁוּב);
apostate, i.e. idolatrous
KJV: backsliding, frowardly, turn away (from margin).

H7727.definition:
the same as H7726 (שׁוֹבָב); rebellious;
Shobab, the name of two Israelites
KJV: Shobab.

H7728.definition:
from H7725 (שׁוּב);
apostate, i.e. heathenish or (actually) heathen
KJV: backsliding.

H7729.definition:
from H7725 (שׁוּב);
a return
KJV: returning.

H7730.definition:
for H5441 (סֹבֶךְ);
a thicket, i.e. interlaced branches
KJV: thick boughs.

H7731.definition:
perhaps for H7730 (שׂוֹבֶךְ);
Shobak, a Syrian
KJV: Shobach.

H7732.definition:
from the same as H7640 (שֹׁבֶל); overflowing;
Shobal, the name of an Edomite and two Israelites
KJV: Shobal.

H7733.definition:
active participle from a primitive root meaning to leave (compare H7662 (שְׁבַק)); forsaking;
Shobek, an Israelite
KJV: Shobek.

H7734.definition:
a primitive root;
to retreat
KJV: turn back.

H7735.definition:
a primitive root;
to hedge in
KJV: make to grow.

H7736.definition:
a primitive root;
properly, to swell up, i.e. figuratively (by implication of insolence) to devastate
KJV: waste.

H7737.definition:
a primitive root;
properly, to level, i.e. equalize; figuratively, to resemble; by implication, to adjust (i.e. counterbalance, be suitable, compose, place, yield, etc.)
KJV: avail, behave, bring forth, compare, countervail, (be, make) equal, lay, be (make, a-) like, make plain, profit, reckon.

H7738.definition:
a primitive root;
to destroy
KJV: [idiom] substance (from the margin).

H7739.definition:
(Aramaic); corresponding to H7737 (שָׁוָה);
to resemble
KJV: make like.

H7740.definition:
from H7737 (שָׁוָה); plain;
Shaveh, a place in Palestine
KJV: Shaveh.

H7741.definition:
from the same as H7740 (שָׁוֵה) and the dual of H7151 (קִרְיָה); plain of a double city;
Shaveh-Kirjathajim, a place East of the Jordan
KJV: Shaveh Kiriathaim.

H7742.definition:
a primitive root;
to muse pensively
KJV: meditate.

H7743.definition:
a primitive root;
to sink, literally or figuratively
KJV: bow down, incline, humble.

H7744.definition:
from H7743 (שׁוּחַ); dell;
